	(text "02 - Optical flow sensor\nPMW3360DM-T2QU with LM19-LSI lens, floor-facing, lens flange 2.4 +-0.2 mm above the mat.\nCore VDD 1V9, VDDIO 3V3 (no level shifting to the ESP32-P4), VDDPIX bypass 4.7u + 100n,\nLED through 39R, reset tied high, 10k pull-up on ~{CS} so the sensor stays deselected at boot.\nSPI at <= 2 MHz over the GH10 cable. Support values from the alpha optical board (built, working)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 25 0)
		(effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b1a00003-0000-4000-8000-000000000068"))
